{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788372856000-453d18", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "出差补贴的标准是多少？住宿发票抬头怎么开？", "id": "891c5b56fd1b4b8d908f7a22e4eaf5c0", "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:14:16", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "d78aeb93f1d244e993cd209a1cc726b0", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:14:16", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "28a3ab18baeb4e95a760d74ad09cd6bb", "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:14:24", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T18:14:56"}, {"type": "text", "text": "出差补贴：**市内不出差；省内 100 元/天、省外 150 元/天**（含餐费），按离开/返回当日半天计。\n住宿发票抬头：广东金汉隆智能装备科技有限公司（统一社会信用代码在 OA 首页公告），开票前先查最新税号，抬头错的一律退回重开。", "id": "522c22d065734e4c9d32d2954525dec6", "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:14:24", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T18:14:56"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "039e5f3687754dc3adbdd9f28ac6c407", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:14:24", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-02T18:14:56", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "发票丢了怎么办？", "id": "d6aa391c9dd44ef79c289df18e93066c", "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:20:16", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "1106b6dd1de841108af23a476289e817", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:20:16", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "7409f8077f1d4e59be673053da76be40", "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:20:24", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T18:20:56"}, {"type": "text", "text": "增值税专票丢了可向销售方申请复印记账联+盖章情况说明；普票/电子票可重新打印或让对方补开 red 字冲销后重开。实在无法补的，写情况说明+部门经理签字，按标准的 70% 报销。", "id": "683a98039665476488f13762d8658d59", "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:20:24", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T18:20:56"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "a3ce0ea92d6245ad8c6437ff14fc0e65", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:20:24", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-02T18:20:56", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "补贴按自然天还是工作天算？", "id": "185bfe7c50564acdb680f993e4ca97aa", "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:21:56", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "17b5316def054feaac73163fbf1a1a8f", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:21:56", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "1df699f97b6b496095d4510c5936c98c", "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:22:02", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T18:22:41"}, {"type": "text", "text": "按自然天：出差期间含周末都算在途，这是通行口径；但如果周末是客户安排的休整（无工作安排），往返当日算、中间周末不算，制度里写死一种避免扯皮。", "id": "2bba24b85ea840e987018256c4098074", "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:22:02", "finished_at": "2026-09-02T18:22:41"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "62b6d7a7305e43b4988fd703232fd969", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T18:22:02", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-02T18:22:41", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}